{
  "title": "The Walking Dead (Raw Thrills)",
  "enabled": false,
  "status": "niet-getest",
  "arch": "i386",
  "loader": "rg-elfloader",
  "launcher": "gamescope",
  "mounts": [
    {
      "src": "@nas/Walking Dead",
      "dst": "/pm",
      "mode": "overlay"
    }
  ],
  "files": [
    {
      "src": "@patches/WalkingDead/dropin/eerste-plt-slots.tsv",
      "dst": "/rg/wd-slots.tsv"
    },
    {
      "src": "@patches/WalkingDead/dropin/hasp-haken.ini",
      "dst": "/rg/hasp-haken.ini"
    }
  ],
  "seed": [
    {
      "src": "@patches/WalkingDead/dropin/ravengun-hasp",
      "dst": "/pm/ravengun-hasp"
    }
  ],
  "libs": [
    "@lib32/libcsv.so",
    "@lib32/libssl.so.1.0.0",
    "@lib32/libcrypto.so.1.0.0",
    "@lib32/libGLU.so.1",
    "@build/lib32/libcaca.so.0",
    "@build/lib32/librg-threadprio.so",
    "@build/lib32/librg_rio_bridge.so",
    "@build/lib32/librg-glslfix.so",
    "@patches/WalkingDead/dropin/libravengun-hasphook.so",
    "@patches/WalkingDead/dropin/ravengun-hasp.so"
  ],
  "preload": "/rg/lib/libravengun-hasphook.so:/rg/lib/librg-threadprio.so:/rg/lib/librg_rio_bridge.so:/rg/lib/librg-glslfix.so",
  "env": {
    "RG_ELF_SLOT_TABLE": "/rg/wd-slots.tsv",
    "RAVENGUN_HASP_GAME": "WalkingDead",
    "RAVENGUN_HASP_DIR": "/pm/ravengun-hasp",
    "RAVENGUN_HASP_ELF_LIB": "/rg/lib/ravengun-hasp.so",
    "RAVENGUN_HASP_ELF_ADRESLIJST": "/rg/hasp-haken.ini",
    "RAVENGUN_HASP_VERBOSE": "1",
    "RG_RIO_LOG": "1",
    "RG_ELF_PTRACER_ANY": "1",
    "RG_GLSLFIX_LOG": "1",
    "RG_ELF_MAIN": "1"
  },
  "note": "Native route opgezet (2026-10-15): rg-elfloader met de eerste-PLT-slottabel (806/806, __pow_finite -> pow), RG_ELF_MAIN=1 (de dump is na de constructors gemaakt; main wordt als functie aangeroepen), eigen libcaca-stub, HASP-hook met adreslijst (anker: patch van Aliens Armageddon, verschuiving +0x15e970), RIO-brug, RG_ELF_PTRACER_ANY, rg-glslfix. Gemeten: \"Welcome to Walking Dead v01.05\", dongleaanroepen komen binnen. GEBLOKKEERD op gegevens: de game ontsleutelt zijn databestanden via hasp_decrypt/hasp_encrypt (invoer f3348bcd..., c0f440bd...) en de spelmap heeft geen hasp/-antwoordtafel en geen hhl_mem.dmp; 41 RTDT/adj-bestanden laden niet en de game valt om.",
  "exe": "/pm/game",
  "cwd": "/pm",
  "home": "/pm",
  "args": [
    "-f{res}",
    "-e"
  ],
  "res": "1920x1080",
  "route": "tp-shm",
  "extra_ro": [
    "/dev/shm/ravengun_JvsState"
  ]
}
